        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>方法40 指读（Pointing Reading）</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px 40px 20px 30px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    position: relative;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .page-header {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .banner {\n    background: #2b2b2b;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .title-block {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    background: #2b2b2b;\n    color: #fff;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n    width: 90%;\n  }\n  .title-number {\n    background: #444;\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    border-right: 1px solid #666;\n  }\n  .title-main {\n    padding: 8px 20px;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .side-tab {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 190px;\n    background: #eeeeee;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    padding: 10px 4px;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .content {\n    max-width: 78%;\n  }\n  .highlight-box {\n    border: 2px solid #f5a25d;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 18px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .underline-orange {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #f5a25d;\n    display: inline;\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .indent-block {\n    margin-left: 1.5em;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 260px;\n    height: 220px;\n    margin: 10px 0 0 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    border: 1px dashed #ccc;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      45deg, #fff, #fff 10px, #fafafa 10px, #fafafa 20px\n    );\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"page-header\">平读 Plain reading</div>\n\n  <div class=\"banner\">用手指来指引读书的方向</div>\n\n  <div class=\"title-block\">\n    <div class=\"title-number\">方法 40</div>\n    <div class=\"title-main\">指读 （Pointing Reading）</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"side-tab\">方法4[?]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"highlight-box\">① 用手指或是笔尖指着当前读到的位置</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"indent-block\">\n      <span class=\"underline-orange\">视线聚焦在手指或笔尖。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"highlight-box\">② 沿着阅读的方向移动手指或笔尖</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"indent-block\">\n      <span class=\"underline-orange\">一边往下读，一边移动手指或笔尖。此时视线依然聚焦在<br>\n      手指或笔尖。手指（或笔尖）的移动速度与我们阅读的速度相<br>\n      同。这样一来，我们的阅读速度会受到手指（或笔尖）移动速<br>\n      度的制约，但是可以保证不会出现倒退或是看错行的情况。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"indent-block\">\n      <span class=\"underline-orange\">大家也可以试着将<br>\n      这种方式与朗读结合起<br>\n      来，将指着的内容出声<br>\n      读出来。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">\n      [Illustration: hand-drawn cartoon<br>creature with book, bottom-right]\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
